# {{NAME}} design system

{{DESCRIPTION}}

Platforms: {{PLATFORMS}}. Styling: {{STYLING_LABEL}}. Direction: {{DIRECTION}}. Both themes (light and dark) work everywhere
unless `PLUMB.md` says `Themes: light-only`. The look lives in [design.md](design.md); the values live in one tokens file.

## When to use

Any time you create, change, review or ask about UI in this project. Read this file first, then only the files you need.

## Files

