|---|---|
| [design.md](design.md) | Any doubt about the look: brand, colours, type, elevation, motion. It wins every disagreement. |
| [assets/tokens/{{SLUG}}.tokens.json](assets/tokens/{{SLUG}}.tokens.json) | A value seems missing or wrong. Edit ONLY here, then `make tokens`. |
| [assets/icons/icon-map.json](assets/icons/icon-map.json) | Picking an icon: add the concept here first. |
